  "id": 1304,
  "description": "A bunch of goobers, Say inside jokes, say outside jokes, do fishing, don&#039;t do fishing, flick in and out of reality! we don&#039;t care! just make sure you are not a jerk, or we will turn you into a spirit Halloween decoration (THIS IS A JOKE WE WONT DO THAT PLEASE DONT BAN US)\nBut jokes aside, everyone is welcome, just be patient with us :)\n\nAs our first task we have been working on the materials for the guildhall and coordinating days and times for group challenges for marks. Feel free to add my toons, JayBizzle and Merlynn I just started a new toon and will bring them aboard as soon as they are good level and area for gathering. Happy fishing!!\n\nAnd you know what that means! F I S H",
